# Distribute Tracks Inside the Container

If the grid tracks don't fill the entire container (e.g., fixed‑width columns in a wide container), these properties position the whole grid.

Same values as Flexbox: `start`, `end`, `center`, `stretch`, `space-between`, `space-around`, `space-evenly`.

```css
.container {
  grid-template-columns: 200px 200px;
  justify-content: center; /* centre the two‑column group horizontally */
}
```
`place-content` shorthand: `place-content: center space-between;` (align-content, justify-content).

slides.codeSnippet:
.container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 300px);
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 20px;
}
